  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{D9298B4267FC5C09}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "a. Enemy Forces:"\
     "G2 indicates enemy consists of a Separatist platoon in a defensive position around the Villa at Lake Krolyk And one platoon defending the area around bridge 894. G2 has advised that they are equipped with small-arms such as AK-74s, RPKs, RPGs, PKM and SVD. G2 believes they will dig in and put up a strong defence of the villa."\
     ""\
     "Russian and Separatist Forces are operating to the north on the west bank of the river in various concentrations and could take actions to reinforce the villa or cut off forces at the bridge."\
     ""\
     "b. Friendly Forces:"\
     "4 Delta troops are located East of Bridge 894 on the opising river side"\
     ""\
     "c. Terrain:"\
     "Wide Deep river to our east with various crossing points. Dense urban to the south thinning out to the west. Direct west is a wooded river leading to Lake krolyk. North is open fields interspersed with small woods. East if the river and the awaiting extraction force pickup."\
     ""\
     "d. Weather:"\
     "Weather is clear and with a full moon. Winds mild. Ground is soft and muddy but should not impede movement."\
     ""\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
